Terminalite
Copyright 2026 Sasebo AI Project

This product includes model weights trained on (instruction, command) pairs whose commands were in part
extracted from Nemotron-Terminal-Corpus by NVIDIA, licensed under CC BY 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). The commands were filtered, deduplicated and paired with
newly written instructions; the corpus itself is not redistributed here.
  Pi et al., "On Data Engineering for Scaling LLM Terminal Capabilities", arXiv:2602.21193, 2026.

The tokenizer vocabulary (bpe16k.json) was trained on the instructions and commands of the training data
and on the instruction text of the NL2SH training set (Westenfelder et al., NAACL 2025).

The training instructions and most training commands were generated by large language models and checked
by execution in a sandbox; the training data is not distributed.
